A '''Wumpa''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Critter]] that can be found in the {{Blue|Icy}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Wumpa''' spawns in a cavern within the {{Blue|Icy}} biome upon capturing one of every other {{mt|Critter}} type in the {{Blue|Icy}} biome in one run.

== Behavior ==
A '''Wumpa''' spawns sleeping. Throwing a {{Item|Critter Capsule}} or {{Item|Masterful Critter Capsule}} at it wakes it up, causing it to run into the black pillar in the center of the cave and become stunned. This causes the entrances to the cavern to become blocked with snow. After recovering, it runs at high speeds around the cavern, vanishing into the walls.  If a {{Item|Critter Capsule}} is thrown at a '''Wumpa''' and is caught, it dies, drops its loot, and melts the snow blocking the entrance.

In order to re-enter the area when blocked, one has to enter via a small hole located near {{Coordinates|-97.5|84|-64.5}}.

